When the market pulls back, that point where the absorption takes place,

627
00:29:30,329 --> 00:29:33,794
才是我真正关注的关键参考点。
that’s the real reference point I’m interested in.

629
00:29:41,011 --> 00:29:43,133
并迅速推动价格上涨。
and very quickly navigated higher.

630
00:29:43,133 --> 00:29:46,528
所以，这是一个很难抓到的入场点。
So, a really tricky one to get onto.

633
00:29:46,790 --> 00:29:49,930
我们可以看到市场在单向框架下持续创新高。
We can see the market just kept rotating higher and higher in a one-time framing manner.

635
00:29:49,930 --> 00:29:56,781
我给你展示这个例子的原因是，很多时候，
The reason I want to show you this example is because a lot of the time,

636
00:29:56,781 --> 00:30:02,347
我们可能看到第一次回调就认为这是回调。
we may look at this first rotation and think that is the rotation.

640
00:30:02,350 --> 00:30:05,163
那只是回调的开始阶段。
That is the beginning process of a pullback.

641
00:30:05,163 --> 00:30:08,328
作为经验法则，在主动驱动中，
As a rule of thumb, in an initiative drive,

642
00:30:08,328 --> 00:30:12,548
回调应该至少持续几分钟或几个循环。
the pullback should be at least a couple of minutes or rotations.

643
00:30:12,770 --> 00:30:17,470
为什么？因为根据定义，当出现主动驱动时，
Why? Because, by definition, when there’s initiation, the market is trying to find some sort of responsive liquidity.

646
00:30:17,470 --> 00:30:26,507
市场正在寻找某种响应性流动性。
If someone is responding to higher prices, i.e., a seller, we should see it continue for some time.

648
00:30:26,507 --> 00:30:28,409
如果有人对更高价格做出响应，即卖家，
Not just one rotation.

650
00:30:29,430 --> 00:30:31,144
我们应看到它持续一段时间。
That’s the real clue.

651
00:30:31,144 --> 00:30:34,573
不只是一个循环。
This did continue to extend in a one-time framing manner.

652
00:30:34,573 --> 00:30:38,688
这就是真正的线索。
Eventually, it pulled back and gave us the opportunity to enter long.

653
00:30:39,170 --> 00:30:44,830
这个例子确实在单向框架下持续延伸。
That’s the initiative drive. Now, go and practice that in the slides ahead.

