671
02:12:16,930 --> 02:12:20,593
市场的走势方式、波动类型
The way the market will move, the type of volatility,

672
02:12:20,593 --> 02:12:23,157
拍卖过程的推进方式
the way the auction process takes place,

673
02:12:23,157 --> 02:12:27,187
多空交互会大不相同
the interaction between the buyers and sellers will be very different,

674
02:12:27,187 --> 02:12:30,484
取决于是平衡还是失衡状态
depending on whether we're in balanced or imbalanced conditions.

676
02:12:30,630 --> 02:12:33,210
