682
02:12:44,930 --> 02:12:52,910
入场位置可在区间中点或极端位
In terms of trade location, this can begin mid-range or at extremes.

685
02:12:53,450 --> 02:13:01,750
市场条件角度，参与者角度：主动驱动指大周期参与者
In terms of market conditioning, in terms of the participants: Initiative means large-timeframe participants.

688
02:13:01,850 --> 02:13:09,510
经验法则：提到主动驱动，即需大周期参与者推动价格
Rule of thumb: Whenever we speak about initiative, it means we require large-timeframe participants to ultimately drive the price.

690
02:13:09,670 --> 02:13:10,810
好，他们启动过程
Okay. So, they begin the process

