Now, obviously, you do get other participants joining as price begins the process of exploration.

694
02:13:19,750 --> 02:13:25,870
流动性角度：若在开盘出现，流动性通常较低
In terms of liquidity, if we see this at the open, we tend to have low liquidity. Okay.

697
02:13:25,870 --> 02:13:27,150
市场中策略较少
Not many strategies in the market.

698
02:13:27,570 --> 02:13:32,093
我们曾说其结果可能是某种形式的失衡
We said what the result of this would be is likely some form of imbalances

