02:13:34,850 --> 02:13:38,070
若在盘初出现，走势会非常激进
So, it will look quite aggressive if we see this at the beginning of a session.

703
02:13:38,350 --> 02:13:42,530
而盘中流动性更高，策略更多，流动性也更充足
Versus later on, we have higher liquidity as there are more strategies in the market and ultimately more liquidity available.

706
02:13:48,110 --> 02:13:51,330
波动性角度：开盘驱动因流动性不足波动更高
In terms of volatility, higher with the open drive versus mid-session simply because of that lack of liquidity.

707
02:13:51,850 --> 02:13:58,890
总体来看，价格扩展会在两种变体中出现
Overall, price expansion occurs with both variations. So, it doesn’t matter what time of day it comes in,

709
02:13:58,890 --> 02:14:03,404
你会看到非常激进的波动
you’re going to get some very aggressive volatility

710
02:14:03,404 --> 02:14:10,426
因为主动驱动的本质即包含某种波动
as the nature of initiative drive is, which ultimately includes some form of volatility.

713
02:14:11,150 --> 02:14:15,790
好。我们现在来关注策略识别。
