Look where the buyers are being aggressive.

718
02:14:29,500 --> 02:14:30,900
观察空头主动进攻的位置。
Look where the sellers are being aggressive.

719
02:14:31,740 --> 02:14:33,160
仔细查看Delta阴影部分。
Really look at those delta shadings.

720
02:14:33,160 --> 02:14:36,850
这样才能理解策略中的交互逻辑。
So that you can understand this interaction in the strategy.

721
