02:14:41,280 --> 02:14:46,260
响应性抛售仅指Delta口袋定位或高成交量区域。
Responsive simply means delta pocket positioning or high-volume areas.

724
02:14:46,560 --> 02:14:51,400
我们会持续发起驱动，直到市场找到最终流动性。
And we will initiate until the market can find that ultimate liquidity.

726
02:14:52,140 --> 02:14:55,960
要注意，这是一种非常激进的交互类型。
Do note, this is a very aggressive type of interaction.

727
02:14:56,240 --> 02:14:58,254
你会发现，即使找到流动性后，
You’ll see, even once we do find that liquidity,

