02:15:01,480 --> 02:15:08,420
在指标方面，主动驱动时成交量总是很高。为什么？
Now, in terms of the metrics, volume will always be high in initiative drives. Why?

731
02:15:08,600 --> 02:15:11,420
因为主动驱动意味着新增交易。
Because initiative means new business.

732
02:15:11,540 --> 02:15:16,960
新增交易推动价格上涨，吸引更多参与者，从而带来更多交易。
As new business comes in and drives price higher, it brings in more participants, which means even more business.

735
02:15:17,360 --> 02:15:19,980
在时间方面，这是一个非常关键的要素。
In terms of time, it’s a very key proponent.

736
02:15:20,320 --> 02:15:22,731
就像我之前提到的，开盘驱动，
Like I mentioned earlier, cash open,

