02:16:46,510 --> 02:16:50,734
所以，出现主动驱动时，别怕设稍宽的止损。
So, don’t be afraid to have a slightly wider stop when there is that initiative.

770
02:16:50,734 --> 02:16:55,750
如前所述，盘初的主动驱动延伸概率更高。
Like I said, there’s a high probability for extension if it occurs early in the session versus later.

772
02:16:59,165 --> 02:17:02,629
所以，别怕采用稍宽的风险参数。
So, don’t be afraid to adopt a slightly wider risk metric.

