我的建议：别急着入场。市场会奖励早观察和耐心执行
My tip: don't rush in. The market will reward early observation and patient execution.

802
02:18:36,750 --> 02:18:39,250
这是主动驱动的关键建议之一
And that's one of the key tips for the Initiative Drive.

803
02:18:39,410 --> 02:18:42,752
别急着入场。让其他人慌张入场
